within ThermoSysPro.MultiFluids;

package Boilers "Boilers"
  extends ThermoSysPro.UsersGuide.Documentation.ThermoSysProPackageIcon;
  annotation(Documentation(info = "## Copyright © EDF 2002 - 2025

## ThermoSysPro Version 4.2

Boilers  


Boilers produce hot water or steam using thermal energy released by the combustion of the fuel.  
Steam at the desired temperature and pressure is used to produce mechanical energy via a steam turbine.  

For a better understanding of the underlying physics, see Chap. 7 of :cite:`el19`.  



     

    "));
end Boilers;